# Author order: the byline of the paper (Medina, Tomàs, Lérida, Guirado, da Silva).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproduction package, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "KubeSBS: A Reproducible Measurement Framework for Kubernetes Cluster Simulators (reproduction package)"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package of the paper "KubeSBS: A Reproducible Measurement Framework for
  Kubernetes Cluster Simulators": a frozen copy of KubeSBS v0.4.0, the captured results
  of every experiment (six simulators and vanilla Kubernetes, 100 to 1,200 nodes, two
  sessions; and the fidelity study of KWOK against a real k3s cluster), and a Docker
  environment that regenerates every data figure and table of the paper and checks
  them against the published versions.
